WEBVTT

00:00:01.315 --> 00:00:13.159
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:18.899
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:25.805
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:37.342
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:43.490
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:50.896
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:58.661
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.705 --> 00:01:05.579
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.579 --> 00:01:11.142
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:17.424
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.424 --> 00:01:25.889
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:49.750
-Thoma!
-Helga!

00:01:49.923 --> 00:01:52.687
-Thoma!
-Helga!

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.729
O-Ouch!

00:01:55.729 --> 00:01:58.493
You're being undignified,
Big Sister!

00:02:01.301 --> 00:02:03.269
Helga!

00:02:04.171 --> 00:02:05.472
Helga!

00:02:05.472 --> 00:02:07.841
-She disappeared!
-He sent her somewhere!

00:02:07.841 --> 00:02:10.275
Let's find her, Hasmodye!

00:02:13.113 --> 00:02:14.614
You insignificant scum.

00:02:14.614 --> 00:02:16.548
Helga!

00:02:18.185 --> 00:02:19.584
Thoma!

00:02:37.871 --> 00:02:39.361
Damn!

00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:52.519
-Thoma!
-Wonder! Go!

00:02:52.519 --> 00:02:56.421
You earthling! Don't go
near my sister again!

00:02:58.558 --> 00:03:00.355
Tina...

00:03:00.861 --> 00:03:02.590
This boy...

00:03:09.603 --> 00:03:11.867
Thoma, are you okay?!

00:03:13.573 --> 00:03:15.308
I...

00:03:15.308 --> 00:03:19.074
Just now, I saw Tina's face.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.911
Thoma.

00:03:24.251 --> 00:03:26.549
You've been injured by Dumas!

00:03:28.388 --> 00:03:33.325
THE TRUTH ABOUT THOMA

00:03:34.327 --> 00:03:37.197
-Done!
-Thank you, Chitto.

00:03:37.197 --> 00:03:41.065
-Are you okay?
-This is just a scratch. Let's go!

00:04:28.682 --> 00:04:30.980
Thoma?

00:04:31.418 --> 00:04:33.648
Thoma!

00:06:08.248 --> 00:06:10.443
Tina.

00:06:12.285 --> 00:06:14.515
-Princess Tina!
-Tina?

00:06:14.788 --> 00:06:16.956
The person Helga
was a long time ago?

00:06:16.956 --> 00:06:18.218
Yes.

00:06:19.025 --> 00:06:21.619
S-She's a giant!

00:06:54.794 --> 00:06:59.026
She couldn't hear my voice.

00:06:59.599 --> 00:07:03.228
But she could hear his voice?

00:07:24.457 --> 00:07:26.118
Tina.

00:07:26.326 --> 00:07:29.295
I have always protected you.

00:07:34.234 --> 00:07:39.570
Ever since we were little,
I've always protected you.

00:07:40.707 --> 00:07:43.369
My... Tina.

00:07:53.753 --> 00:07:58.622
I don't exist in Tina's heart.

00:07:59.893 --> 00:08:01.861
I...

00:08:19.546 --> 00:08:22.682
Transfer her soul?

00:08:22.682 --> 00:08:25.985
Yes. As long as Princess Tina's
soul is gone,

00:08:25.985 --> 00:08:28.121
the mechanism will not function.

00:08:28.121 --> 00:08:32.559
The body left behind will just
decay like ordinary flesh.

00:08:32.559 --> 00:08:34.494
It won't become a weapon.

00:08:34.494 --> 00:08:36.485
The Earth...

00:08:39.532 --> 00:08:43.102
You heard them, Tina.
Let's believe in them.

00:08:43.102 --> 00:08:44.771
I'll go, too.

00:08:44.771 --> 00:08:47.240
That way, I know
we'll find each other.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.741
I know we'll find each other!

00:08:48.741 --> 00:08:50.732
Soran.

00:09:03.456 --> 00:09:05.525
The Orsel intensity is increasing.

00:09:05.525 --> 00:09:08.061
One hundred twenty-seven.
One hundred and seventy five.

00:09:08.061 --> 00:09:10.052
Two hundred and thirteen.

00:09:13.233 --> 00:09:17.465
Transfer... Tina's soul.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.288
Gueroca's troops!

00:09:35.288 --> 00:09:37.017
Behave yourselves!

00:09:39.959 --> 00:09:42.061
Tina! I promise I'll go!

00:09:42.061 --> 00:09:44.264
I promise I'll go to wherever you are!

00:09:44.264 --> 00:09:45.899
Don't forget! Tina!

00:09:45.899 --> 00:09:49.602
Soran! I'll always be waiting for you!

00:09:49.602 --> 00:09:52.572
Until I see you again, always!

00:09:52.572 --> 00:09:54.733
Always!

00:09:55.041 --> 00:09:58.499
I'll find you no matter what.

00:10:04.851 --> 00:10:09.618
I won't let you have Tina's soul.

00:10:21.434 --> 00:10:24.961
Soran!

00:10:32.011 --> 00:10:33.945
Seth?

00:10:52.432 --> 00:10:55.162
Ti... na...

00:11:51.591 --> 00:11:55.152
Soran!

00:12:01.401 --> 00:12:02.468
Soran!

00:12:02.468 --> 00:12:04.670
Soran! Soran!

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.539
Soran! Soran!

00:12:06.539 --> 00:12:08.141
Soran! Soran!

00:12:08.141 --> 00:12:09.909
Soran! Soran!

00:12:09.909 --> 00:12:11.344
Soran!

00:12:11.344 --> 00:12:13.209
Soran!

00:12:16.749 --> 00:12:18.551
Soran! Soran!

00:12:18.551 --> 00:12:20.143
Soran!

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:23.011
Soran!

00:12:25.191 --> 00:12:26.325
I...

00:12:26.325 --> 00:12:27.727
I...

00:12:27.727 --> 00:12:31.631
Please forgive me.
Soran... Soran...

00:12:31.631 --> 00:12:33.566
What a betrayal...

00:12:33.566 --> 00:12:36.836
So stupid... So stupid!

00:12:36.836 --> 00:12:39.669
Soran... Soran...

00:12:42.708 --> 00:12:44.505
Tina!

00:13:02.161 --> 00:13:04.129
Tina...

00:13:08.401 --> 00:13:10.236
Please forgive me!

00:13:10.236 --> 00:13:13.506
Soran... Tina...

00:13:13.506 --> 00:13:17.610
Forgive my mistake.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:20.170
Forgive me.

00:14:53.673 --> 00:14:55.041
Wonder!

00:14:55.041 --> 00:14:57.635
-Tarlant!
-Aghi!

00:14:59.178 --> 00:15:00.975
Princess Tina!

00:15:03.816 --> 00:15:07.053
Thoma?! What's the matter with him?!

00:15:07.053 --> 00:15:11.591
I don't know! He suddenly
started screaming.

00:15:11.591 --> 00:15:15.027
Thoma's hair is...

00:15:27.206 --> 00:15:31.143
Forgive me!
Soran, Tina...

00:15:31.143 --> 00:15:35.114
Forgive my mistake.
Please forgive me.

00:15:35.114 --> 00:15:37.483
Forgive me!

00:15:37.483 --> 00:15:39.986
Soran... Tina...

00:15:39.986 --> 00:15:43.752
Forgive my mistake.
Please forgive me.

00:15:45.057 --> 00:15:47.460
Please forgive me.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.795
Soran...

00:15:49.795 --> 00:15:51.922
Tina...

00:16:10.283 --> 00:16:14.787
Greecia.
Greecia belongs to me, Titus!

00:16:14.787 --> 00:16:17.189
Even though I was born
in the royal family,

00:16:17.189 --> 00:16:21.717
because of a short space of time,
I wasn't able to become king.

00:16:23.596 --> 00:16:26.999
Titus's sin is being my older brother,

00:16:26.999 --> 00:16:30.730
being his younger brother
is my tragedy.

00:16:33.272 --> 00:16:36.008
You're jealous of your older brother?

00:16:36.008 --> 00:16:37.999
How childish.

00:16:38.277 --> 00:16:41.303
What did you say, Dumas?

00:16:42.782 --> 00:16:47.276
In the end, Mother was
a victim of that jealousy.

00:16:51.957 --> 00:16:55.449
She was certainly killed
by a childish person.

00:16:57.296 --> 00:16:59.856
You bastard!

00:17:01.901 --> 00:17:04.893
And that blood flows in me.

00:17:05.071 --> 00:17:06.698
How disgusting.

00:17:09.175 --> 00:17:12.235
How dare you speak to me that way!

00:17:13.479 --> 00:17:16.243
Is that any way to act
towards your father?

00:17:22.822 --> 00:17:24.423
This boy...

00:17:24.423 --> 00:17:26.220
Dumas.

00:17:32.264 --> 00:17:33.993
Dumas!

00:17:36.402 --> 00:17:37.670
Stop this!

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.729
You said...

00:17:40.005 --> 00:17:43.907
You said that you're going
back to Greecia. But...

00:17:44.176 --> 00:17:46.746
But what is Dumas going to do?

00:17:46.746 --> 00:17:49.648
How is he supposed to go on
living with this body?

00:17:49.648 --> 00:17:52.551
Even if he goes back to Greecia,
my little brother won't be able to live!

00:17:52.551 --> 00:17:55.952
Have you ever thought
about Dumas's feelings?

00:18:00.059 --> 00:18:02.061
Are you saying that,

00:18:02.061 --> 00:18:04.230
your father thought about
his daughter's feelings

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:06.960
when he turned you into a weapon?

00:18:13.372 --> 00:18:15.674
My mother...

00:18:15.674 --> 00:18:19.007
What must she have been feeling
when she apologized to me?

00:18:19.879 --> 00:18:24.016
How emotional must Father have
been, to try and hold on to my...

00:18:24.016 --> 00:18:26.644
to Tina's life?

00:18:27.853 --> 00:18:29.989
My little brother, Dumas.

00:18:29.989 --> 00:18:32.856
What did he feel living
his life all alone?

00:18:34.527 --> 00:18:36.429
You are Dumas's father!

00:18:36.429 --> 00:18:39.498
As a parent, you should be willing
to risk your life to protect your child!

00:18:39.498 --> 00:18:41.932
That's enough, Big Sister.

00:18:53.312 --> 00:18:55.481
-Dumas...
-Dumas!

00:18:55.481 --> 00:18:58.818
I'm sure you must feel
better after defying me.

00:18:58.818 --> 00:19:01.981
Put this girl inside the
device immediately!

00:19:02.555 --> 00:19:07.959
Make my longtime dream
come true, my son.

00:19:26.712 --> 00:19:30.978
Come, Big Sister.
Let's go.

00:20:10.489 --> 00:20:13.325
Dumas, I beg of you.

00:20:13.325 --> 00:20:16.061
Don't commit a sin.

00:20:16.061 --> 00:20:17.995
I beg of you.

00:20:33.979 --> 00:20:35.981
Big Sister.

00:20:35.981 --> 00:20:37.616
Dumas.

00:20:37.616 --> 00:20:39.516
Dumas.

00:20:41.754 --> 00:20:43.813
Big Sister.

00:21:15.087 --> 00:21:16.884
Thoma.

00:21:20.159 --> 00:21:21.888
His hair is...

00:21:22.194 --> 00:21:23.529
T-Thoma.

00:21:23.529 --> 00:21:26.225
Thoma! What's the matter, Thoma?

00:21:30.035 --> 00:21:31.627
You...

00:21:32.104 --> 00:21:33.806
Aghi! Aghi!

00:21:33.806 --> 00:21:35.841
I did it... I did it!

00:21:35.841 --> 00:21:37.509
I killed Soran!

00:21:37.509 --> 00:21:40.774
I'm the one who killed Soran!

00:21:42.815 --> 00:21:44.874
What are you saying?!

00:21:45.451 --> 00:21:48.253
I-I am... I am...

00:21:48.253 --> 00:21:50.187
Seth!

00:21:51.023 --> 00:21:52.725
I am Seth!

00:21:52.725 --> 00:21:55.125
Aghi!

00:22:35.567 --> 00:22:45.374
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.611 --> 00:22:55.487
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.487 --> 00:23:00.225
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.225 --> 00:23:05.094
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.497 --> 00:23:14.633
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:19.778
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.778 --> 00:23:25.050
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:29.488
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.488 --> 00:23:33.792
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.792 --> 00:23:38.661
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
